CRC Card 1 — Club
Class              Club
Responsibilities  Maintain club identity and description; maintain verification status; organize activities; submit venue requests; maintain representatives
Collaborators	    Club Representative, Club Registration, Club Activity, Venue Request, SRC Member

CRC Card 2 — Club Representative
Class	            Club Representative
Responsibilities	Represent a club; submit club information; update club information; submit venue requests; view booking decisions
Collaborators	    Club, Club Registration, Venue Request, Booking

CRC Card 3 — Administrative Staff
Class	            Administrative Staff
Responsibilities	Review club registrations; approve/reject clubs; review venue requests; allocate venues; allocate times; approve/reject requests
Collaborators	    Club Registration, Club, Venue Request, Venue, Booking

CRC Card 4 — Venue Request
Class	            Venue Request
Responsibilities	Store requested date/time; record facility requirements; record expected attendance; maintain request status; support approval/rejection
Collaborators	    Club, Administrative Staff, Venue, Facility, Booking

CRC Card 5 — Club Activity
Class	            Club Activity
Responsibilities	Store activity details; associate activity with a club; maintain activity date/time; provide information for notifications
Collaborators	    Club, Booking, Notification

CRC Card 6 — Booking
Class	            Booking
Responsibilities	Record allocated venue; record allocated date/time; maintain booking status; prevent conflicting allocations
Collaborators	    Venue, Venue Request, Club Activity, Administrative Staff

